## Testing Checklist {#testing-checklist}

After implementing fixes, test:

### Authentication Flow {#authentication-flow}

- [ ] Login with email \+ password → success
- [ ] Login with wrong password → fails after 5 attempts, account locked
- [ ] Login with 2FA enabled → shows TOTP input
- [ ] Login with valid TOTP → success
- [ ] Login with backup code → success, code consumed
- [ ] Logout → refresh token revoked (can't use old token)
- [ ] Session refresh at `/api/auth/refresh` → new tokens issued

### Rate Limiting {#rate-limiting}

- [ ] Rate limit: 10 login attempts in 15 min from same IP → blocked
- [ ] Rate limit: 5 failed logins on same email → locked
- [ ] Rate limit without Redis → requests rejected (production mode)

### Authorization {#authorization}

- [ ] Finance Admin can't access Teacher Admin routes
- [ ] Teacher Admin can't access Finance routes
- [ ] Super Admin can access all routes
- [ ] Audit logs record all sensitive actions

### Security {#security}

- [ ] CSRF tokens required for login
- [ ] Cookies are httpOnly \+ Secure \+ SameSite
- [ ] No stack traces in error responses
- [ ] Security headers present (CSP, HSTS, etc.)

